<script>
// Scroll to top button
let mybutton = document.getElementById("myBtn");
window.onscroll = function() {scrollFunction()};
function scrollFunction() {
  if (document.body.scrollTop > 20 || document.documentElement.scrollTop > 20) {
    mybutton.style.display = "block";
  } else {
    mybutton.style.display = "none";
  }
}
function topFunction() {
  document.body.scrollTop = 0;
  document.documentElement.scrollTop = 0;
}
</script>

<section class="downheader"></section>
<section class="about-section">
    <div class="about-container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">Last updated: October 11, 2025</div>

        <p>Welcome to <strong>Allgem Games</strong> (<a href="https://allgemgames.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">allgemgames.com</a>). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our website and services.</p>

        <div class="hr"></div>

        <div class="allgem-terms" role="region" aria-label="AllGem Games Privacy Policy">

            <h2>1) Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We collect the following types of information:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Personal Data:</strong> Email address, account credentials, and payment details (via Stripe or PayPal).</li>
                <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, device information, IP address, browser type, and session duration (via Google Analytics).</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>2) How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>We use the collected information to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Process payments and manage transactions</li>
                <li>Register and manage user accounts</li>
                <li>Analyze site performance and user activity</li>
                <li>Provide support and respond to inquiries</li>
                <li>Serve relevant advertisements</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3) Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>We use trusted third-party services for various operations:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Google Analytics – site analytics</li>
                <li>Google AdSense – advertising</li>
                <li>Stripe & PayPal – payment processing</li>
                <li>Featurebase – form submissions and feedback</li>
                <li>GameDistribution – game hosting and analytics</li>
                <li>Cloudflare – security and performance</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Each of these services has its own privacy policy which governs how they handle your data.</p>

            <h2>4) Cookies</h2>
            <p>We use cookies to store user preferences, manage sessions, and improve performance. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, though some parts of the site may not work properly.</p>

            <h2>5) Data Retention</h2>
            <p>We retain personal information only as long as necessary to provide our services, comply with legal obligations, or resolve disputes.</p>

            <h2>6) Data Sharing</h2>
            <p>We do not sell or rent personal data. We share information only with trusted third parties listed above for legitimate purposes such as payments, analytics, and advertising.</p>

            <h2>7) Your Rights</h2>
            <p>Depending on your jurisdiction (e.g., GDPR, CCPA), you may have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Access your personal data</li>
                <li>Request correction or deletion</li>
                <li>Withdraw consent to processing</li>
                <li>Object to certain uses of your data</li>
            </ul>
            <p>To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:allgemgames@gmail.com">allgemgames@gmail.com</a>.</p>

            <h2>8) Data Security</h2>
            <p>We use industry-standard encryption, firewalls, and services like Cloudflare to protect user data from unauthorized access or misuse.</p>

            <h2>9) Children’s Privacy</h2>
            <p>Allgem Games is not directed toward children under 13 (or under 16 in the EU). We do not knowingly collect data from minors.</p>

            <h2>10) Data Deletion Requests</h2>
            <p>You may request account or data deletion by emailing us at <a href="mailto:allgemgames@gmail.com">allgemgames@gmail.com</a>. We will confirm deletion within a reasonable timeframe.</p>

            <h2>11) Updates to This Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Updates will be posted on this page with a revised date.</p>

            <h2>12) Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have questions or concerns about privacy, please contact us at:</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:allgemgames@gmail.com">allgemgames@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://allgemgames.com" target="_blank">allgemgames.com</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

